flowchart TD
    A[Request arrives] --> B{Unhandled exception?}
    B -- Yes --> M1[Return default Manual response]
    B -- No --> C{Existing recommendation?}
    C -- Yes --> C1[Return cached action]
    C -- No --> D{Manual override?}
    D -- Yes --> M3[Return Manual]
    D -- No --> E[Collect signals]
    C1 --> Z[(Database)]
    E --> Z
